  "description": "Brings AI to the Dynamicweb 10 backend: the Dynamo assistant inside the administration UI, plus an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for external AI clients. Dynamo is an AI chat assistant built into the admin, helping editors and administrators enrich products, manage content and commerce, build data models, look up documentation, and automate everyday backend tasks in natural language — using your own API key for Anthropic Claude, OpenAI, or Google Gemini models. The MCP server lets external assistants and agents — Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot, Cursor, or any MCP-compatible client — securely connect to the solution's /admin/mcp endpoint with a Dynamicweb sign-in and use the same tools. Tool coverage spans the whole platform: PIM and product data, e-commerce (shops, prices, discounts, orders, shipping and payment), content (pages, paragraphs, item types), users and groups, media files, email marketing, integration, dashboards, health checks, and searchable Dynamicweb documentation. All operations go through Dynamicweb's standard services and respect the signed-in user's permissions.",
